  "text": "Hotel brands most commonly associated with **branded-residence development in Europe** include:\n\n### Leading and particularly active brands\n- **Mandarin Oriental**\n- **Four Seasons**\n- **Six Senses**\n- **The Ritz-Carlton**\n- **St. Regis**\n- **Kempinski**\n- **Radisson Blu / Radisson**\n- **Swissôtel**\n- **Mövenpick**\n- **One&Only**\n- **Wyndham**\n\nSavills’ Europe 2026 data places Mandarin Oriental first by completed and planned European projects through 2032, followed by Radisson Blu, with Four Seasons and Six Senses jointly next. ([pdf.savills.com](https://pdf.savills.com/documents/branded-residences-europe-report-2026.pdf))\n\n### Other established luxury participants\n- **Fairmont**\n- **Raffles**\n- **Rosewood**\n- **Aman**\n- **Waldorf Astoria**\n- **W Hotels**\n- **EDITION**\n- **Park Hyatt**\n- **InterContinental**\n- **Bulgari Hotels & Resorts**\n- **Maybourne**\n- **Dorchester Collection**\n\n### Important parent groups\n- **Marriott International** — Europe’s largest group by total branded-residence project count, principally through Ritz-Carlton, St. Regis, W and EDITION.\n- **Accor** — has Europe’s strongest development pipeline, spanning brands such as Fairmont, Raffles, Swissôtel and Mövenpick.\n- **Radisson Hotel Group** — increasingly active through Radisson Blu and Radisson.\n- **IHG**, **Hilton** and **Hyatt** — also participate through brands such as Six Senses, InterContinental, Waldorf Astoria and Park Hyatt. ([pdf.savills.com](https://pdf.savills.com/documents/branded-residences-europe-report-2026.pdf))\n\nIn practical development terms, the most recognizable European shortlist would normally be **Mandarin Oriental, Four Seasons, Six Senses, Ritz-Carlton, St. Regis, Kempinski, Fairmont/Raffles and Rosewood**, with Radisson and Accor’s upper-upscale brands relevant where a project is positioned below the ultra-luxury tier. Luxury remains dominant in Europe and is projected to represent approximately 59% of the region’s hotel-branded residential market. ([pdf.savills.com](https://pdf.savills.com/documents/branded-residences-europe-report-2026.pdf))",
